\f0\fs28\b Yamaha YAS-108\b0\fs20\par
\par
DriverWorks driver for the Yamaha \b YAS-108\b0  soundbar. Presents to Control4 as a \b Receiver\b0  proxy: power, volume, mute, input select and surround mode.\par
\par
\b This driver is IR only, and that is a property of the hardware, not a limitation of the driver.\b0  The YAS-108 has no network interface \endash  no wifi, no ethernet, no local API \endash  so there is no way for any driver to read anything back from it. Everything the driver reports is what it last commanded. Read \b Assumed state\b0  below before programming against it.\par
\par
